  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>When you fight giants your combined blows are devastating..</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Twin Thunders<sup>UC</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When you use Twin Thunders, roll your off-handed damage three times and add the results together before adding any bonuses. This additional weapon damage is multiplied on a critical hit.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-combat-n-z-feats#toc128\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
